    description: Some("A Tempest-style shooter played on the faces of a three-dimensional cube. You steer a scorpion around the outside of the cube, shooting spiders that climb toward you; a spider that reaches the edge can knock a piece out of it and leave a hole. A moving hazard, the rail snail, patrols the field, and timing a pass over it as it changes direction earns a bonus."),
